== Toolset ==
* Heavy crossbows are listed in the [[crossbow blueprint category]] on the [[item palette]] in the [[Toolset]].

== Notes ==

*Crossbows will normally only provide one [[attack per round]] no matter the [[creature]]'s [[BAB]]. However, the [[rapid reload]] [[feat]] will allow the same number of attacks per round as allowed by the creatures BAB. [[Effect]]s that provide additional attacks, such as [[haste]] or the [[divine power]] [[spell]] will still work as intended.
*A crossbow's damage is unaffected by its wielder's [[strength]] unless given an explicit [[mighty]] property, so characters with less than 10 strength will not have a damage penalty when wielding most crossbows.
*Crossbows require characters to wield them with two hands regardless of size.